Z||000001||WKDFIRO||03-23-2001||04:41 PM||||It is unfortunate, but essentially FOCOA is a 2 person operation. Gloria and Feiro Phil. As I understand it they do have help come in occasionally but other than that they are two people who are running the mail order business, putting together a magazine, keeping track of the membership, setting up the Nationals, traveling to Fiero shows all across the country and somehow trying to get things that aren't available for Fieros anymore.<P>Its a job they'll never get rich doing, there is no vacation, and no work is done if someone gets sick. No excuses but sometimes if one knows why then maybe someone can help.<P>Ive known them for a long time and they try to do the right thing by people. Often with shocking repercussions. ||||reg||2
